    {
        "content": "<p>auronandace opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14561\">PR #14561</a> from <code>auronandace:upstream-from-redox</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Disclaimer: no AI tools were used in making this PR.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use <code>directories</code> crate instead of <code>directories-next</code> for the <code>cache</code> crate:<ul>\n<li><code>directories-next</code> is unmaintained and calls <code>redox-users</code> 0.4 (which is outdated causing the default config file to not get generated).</li>\n<li><code>directories</code> is maintained and calls the up-to-date <code>redox-users</code> crate fixing config creation.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Redox does not support <code>DSYNC</code> or <code>RSYNC</code>.</li>\n<li>Implement Redox x86_64 support for:<ul>\n<li><code>get_trap_registers()</code></li>\n<li><code>store_handler_in_ucontext()</code></li>\n<li>These require the bump in <code>libc</code> to 0.2.190 to access <code>ucontext_t</code>.<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 629553912,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791295117
    },
