    {
        "content": "<p>pchickey <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14561#issuecomment-6022706949\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14561\">PR #14561</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This PR requires a maintainer to <code>cargo vet</code> new dependencies, some of which can probably be exempted because they only are used on the redox platform which isn't even in our Tier 3 support list. But, right now,  I and other maintainers are dealing with several higher priority issues, so this may be one we have to come back to in a bit - thank you for your contribution and paitience.</p>\n</blockquote>",
